A paint faded through modulateOpacity/modulateColor is not opaque.

- source/renderer/draw.cpp: PathDraw: a paint faded through modulateOpacity or a translucent modulateColor is not opaque - otherwise MSAA mode (WebGL2 without PLS) moves it into the unblended opaque prepass and it replaces the pixels below instead of blending

